{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../set_chat_direct_messages_group/", "title": "set_chat_direct_messages_group()"}, "next": {"link": "../get_dialogs_count/", "title": "get_dialogs_count()"}, "title": "get_dialogs()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"get-dialogs\">\n<h1>get_dialogs()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#get-dialogs\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.Client.get_dialogs\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_dialogs</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.get_dialogs\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get a user\u2019s dialogs sequentially.</p>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\" style=\"color: var(--color-red)\"></i> Bots</span><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>limit</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Limits the number of dialogs to be retrieved.\nBy default, no limit is applied and all dialogs are returned.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>pinned_only</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Pass True if you want to get only pinned dialogs.\nDefaults to False.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>chat_list</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 Chat list from which to get the dialogs; Only Main (0) and Archive (1) chat lists are supported. Defaults to (0) Main chat list.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>offset_date</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">datetime</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 The date starting from which the dialogs need to be fetched. Use 0 or any date in the future to get results from the last dialog.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>offset_message_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 The message identifier of the last message in the last found dialog, or 0 for the first request.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Generator</span></code> \u2013 A generator yielding <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/Dialog/#pyrogram.types.Dialog\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Dialog\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Dialog</span></code></a> objects.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"c1\"># Iterate through all dialogs</span>\n<span class=\"k\">async</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">dialog</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">app</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_dialogs</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dialog</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">chat</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">first_name</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"n\">dialog</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">chat</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">title</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/methods/get_dialogs_count", "get_dialogs_count()", "N", "next"], ["api/methods/set_chat_direct_messages_group", "set_chat_direct_messages_group()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">get_dialogs()</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.Client.get_dialogs\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Client.get_dialogs()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/methods/get_dialogs", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}